  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### How to download a BACS file\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Nov, 2021 at  9:59 AM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nSubmissions > FPS & EPS > Full Payment Summary > BACS File \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nThe BACS file can be downloaded after making the FPS submission to HMRC.\n\nTo download the file, click on 'BACS File'.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
